compact:gap-4 empty:hidden [&amp;&gt;*]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose stacks:[&amp;_li:not(:where([data-cds-theme],[data-cds-theme]_*))::marker]:[--cds-text-secondary:var(--cds-text-primary)]" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">Radim: stranica sa uvodom, očima kornjača, parallax-om, 3D karticama i live demoima (kviz i evidencija) je napisana. Sad povezujem prevod SR/EN, email, ikonicu i sliku za deljenje, pa testiram.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 min-w-0 grid grid-cols-1 content-start gap-5 compact:gap-4 empty:hidden [&amp;&gt;*]:min-w-0 [&amp;&gt;*]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!my-0 print:block print:before:table print:before:-mb-5 print:[&amp;&gt;*]:!mt-5 print:[&amp;&gt;.contents&gt;*]:!mt-5"><div data-find-omitted="" class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 [--msg-block-radius:initial] -my-pad-xs"><div data-closed="" data-cds="TurnStatus" data-testid="TurnStatus" data-state="done" class="group/status flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div data-cds-row="" tabindex="-1" class="flex min-w-0 gap-xs text-start font-sans text-body font-normal items-center py-[calc((var(--cds-h-control)_-_1lh)_/_2)] w-stretch px-xs ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_var(--cds-outset-x,0px)_-_var(--cds-turn-status-hang,0px))] me-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-stop,0px)_-_var(--cds-outset-x,0px))] relative isolate rounded outline-none focus-visible:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-fill-accent)] focu